# Keep the build context to exactly what the Dockerfiles copy.
*
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.predictor
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!dashboard
!ingestion
!ml
# ml/artifacts/ is ~15 GB of LOCAL training runs. The predictor image bakes in
# exactly one PINNED run, which cloudbuild.predictor.yaml stages into
# ml_artifacts/ — a separate name precisely so that un-ignoring ml/ here cannot
# drag every local run into the context (of either image).
ml/artifacts
!ml_artifacts
**/__pycache__
.env
.venv
